{
  "_readme": [
    "Golden vectors for the controller wheel: ONE truth table driven against",
    "BOTH implementations — the Rust machine (gamepad.rs wheel_tests::",
    "golden_vectors_match_both_machines, runs in `cargo test`) and the",
    "shipped JS core (src/frontend/web/assets/wheel-core.js, run with",
    "`node tests/wheel_parity.cjs`). If a geometry or state-machine change",
    "lands on one side only, the other side's run goes red instead of the",
    "phone firing a different slice than the desktop.",
    "Conventions: x/yUp stick axes with yUp positive = up; seat 0 centered",
    "at the top, clockwise; scenario timing is the shipped default feel",
    "(deadzone 0.5, dwells 150 ms, edge 0.9, retract delta 0.1); a scenario",
    "stops at the first mid-hold fire (the wheel closes)."
  ],
  "geometry": [
    { "x": 0.0, "yUp": 1.0, "count": 8, "deadzone": 0.5, "expect": 0 },
    { "x": 1.0, "yUp": 0.0, "count": 8, "deadzone": 0.5, "expect": 2 },
    { "x": 0.0, "yUp": -1.0, "count": 8, "deadzone": 0.5, "expect": 4 },
    { "x": -1.0, "yUp": 0.0, "count": 8, "deadzone": 0.5, "expect": 6 },
    { "x": 0.7, "yUp": 0.7, "count": 8, "deadzone": 0.5, "expect": 1 },
    { "x": 0.7, "yUp": -0.7, "count": 8, "deadzone": 0.5, "expect": 3 },
    { "x": -0.7, "yUp": -0.7, "count": 8, "deadzone": 0.5, "expect": 5 },
    { "x": -0.7, "yUp": 0.7, "count": 8, "deadzone": 0.5, "expect": 7 },
    { "x": 0.342, "yUp": 0.94, "count": 8, "deadzone": 0.5, "expect": 0 },
    { "x": 0.4226, "yUp": 0.9063, "count": 8, "deadzone": 0.5, "expect": 1 },
    { "x": 0.3, "yUp": 0.3, "count": 8, "deadzone": 0.5, "expect": null },
    { "x": 0.3, "yUp": 0.3, "count": 8, "deadzone": 0.25, "expect": 1 },
    { "x": 0.0, "yUp": 1.0, "count": 3, "deadzone": 0.5, "expect": 0 },
    { "x": 1.0, "yUp": 0.0, "count": 3, "deadzone": 0.5, "expect": 1 },
    { "x": 0.0, "yUp": -1.0, "count": 3, "deadzone": 0.5, "expect": 2 },
    { "x": 0.0, "yUp": 1.0, "count": 0, "deadzone": 0.5, "expect": null },
    { "x": 0.0, "yUp": 1.0, "count": 1, "deadzone": 0.5, "expect": 0 },
    { "x": 0.0, "yUp": 0.05, "count": 8, "deadzone": 0.0, "expect": 0 }
  ],
  "_back_placement_note": [
    "back_placement_angle is RUST-ONLY until B7. The desktop places Back by",
    "angle (append as the last seat, rotate the ring so Back's center hits",
    "the anchor); the phone's wheel-core.js still uses the pre-span display-",
    "index rotation and exposes no seat angles, so the node harness skips",
    "this group. B7 ports the angle scheme to JS and folds these back into",
    "the shared contract. expectBackCenterDeg is the aim-convention angle",
    "(0 = up, clockwise) of Back's seat center."
  ],
  "back_placement_angle": [
    { "realCount": 3, "anchor": "up", "expectBackCenterDeg": 0 },
    { "realCount": 3, "anchor": "right", "expectBackCenterDeg": 90 },
    { "realCount": 3, "anchor": "down", "expectBackCenterDeg": 180 },
    { "realCount": 3, "anchor": "left", "expectBackCenterDeg": 270 },
    { "realCount": 7, "anchor": "up", "expectBackCenterDeg": 0 },
    { "realCount": 7, "anchor": "up-right", "expectBackCenterDeg": 45 },
    { "realCount": 7, "anchor": "right", "expectBackCenterDeg": 90 },
    { "realCount": 7, "anchor": "down-right", "expectBackCenterDeg": 135 },
    { "realCount": 7, "anchor": "down", "expectBackCenterDeg": 180 },
    { "realCount": 7, "anchor": "down-left", "expectBackCenterDeg": 225 },
    { "realCount": 7, "anchor": "left", "expectBackCenterDeg": 270 },
    { "realCount": 7, "anchor": "up-left", "expectBackCenterDeg": 315 }
  ],
  "scenarios": [
    {
      "name": "release_dwell_commits_then_release_fires",
      "fireMode": "release",
      "ring": { "labels": ["a", "b", "c"], "folders": [], "inFolder": false, "anchor": "down" },
      "frames": [
        { "t": 0, "x": 0.0, "y": 1.0 },
        { "t": 200, "x": 0.0, "y": 1.0 }
      ],
      "expect": { "aimed": 0, "path": [], "fired": null, "releaseReal": 0 }
    },
    {
      "name": "sweep_never_commits",
      "fireMode": "release",
      "ring": { "labels": ["a", "b", "c"], "folders": [], "inFolder": false, "anchor": "down" },
      "frames": [
        { "t": 0, "x": 0.0, "y": 1.0 },
        { "t": 100, "x": 1.0, "y": 0.0 },
        { "t": 200, "x": 0.0, "y": -1.0 }
      ],
      "expect": { "aimed": null, "path": [], "fired": null, "releaseReal": null }
    },
    {
      "name": "center_then_release_cancels",
      "fireMode": "release",
      "ring": { "labels": ["a", "b", "c"], "folders": [], "inFolder": false, "anchor": "down" },
      "frames": [
        { "t": 0, "x": 0.0, "y": 1.0 },
        { "t": 200, "x": 0.0, "y": 1.0 },
        { "t": 300, "x": 0.0, "y": 0.0 }
      ],
      "expect": { "aimed": null, "path": [], "fired": null, "releaseReal": null }
    },
    {
      "name": "folder_dwell_descends",
      "fireMode": "release",
      "ring": { "labels": ["f", "x"], "folders": [0], "inFolder": false, "anchor": "down" },
      "frames": [
        { "t": 0, "x": 0.0, "y": 1.0 },
        { "t": 160, "x": 0.0, "y": 1.0 }
      ],
      "expect": { "aimed": null, "path": [0], "fired": null }
    },
    {
      "name": "back_dwell_ascends",
      "fireMode": "release",
      "ring": { "labels": ["a", "b", "c"], "folders": [], "inFolder": true, "anchor": "down" },
      "initialPath": [0],
      "frames": [
        { "t": 0, "x": 0.0, "y": -1.0 },
        { "t": 160, "x": 0.0, "y": -1.0 }
      ],
      "expect": { "path": [], "fired": null }
    },
    {
      "name": "edge_below_threshold_never_fires",
      "fireMode": "edge",
      "ring": { "labels": ["a", "b", "c"], "folders": [], "inFolder": false, "anchor": "down" },
      "frames": [
        { "t": 0, "x": 0.0, "y": 0.7 },
        { "t": 500, "x": 0.0, "y": 0.7 }
      ],
      "expect": { "aimed": null, "fired": null }
    },
    {
      "name": "edge_fires_at_threshold_no_dwell",
      "fireMode": "edge",
      "ring": { "labels": ["a", "b", "c"], "folders": [], "inFolder": false, "anchor": "down" },
      "frames": [{ "t": 0, "x": 0.0, "y": 0.95 }],
      "expect": { "fired": 0 }
    },
    {
      "name": "edge_latch_blocks_until_recenter",
      "fireMode": "edge",
      "ring": { "labels": ["a", "b", "c"], "folders": [], "inFolder": false, "anchor": "down" },
      "initialRearm": true,
      "frames": [
        { "t": 0, "x": 0.0, "y": 1.0 },
        { "t": 100, "x": 0.0, "y": 0.0 },
        { "t": 200, "x": 0.0, "y": 1.0 }
      ],
      "expect": { "fired": 0 }
    },
    {
      "name": "retract_peak_then_inward_flick_fires",
      "fireMode": "retract",
      "ring": { "labels": ["a", "b", "c"], "folders": [], "inFolder": false, "anchor": "down" },
      "frames": [
        { "t": 0, "x": 0.0, "y": 1.0 },
        { "t": 200, "x": 0.0, "y": 1.0 },
        { "t": 250, "x": 0.0, "y": 0.95 },
        { "t": 300, "x": 0.0, "y": 0.88 }
      ],
      "expect": { "fired": 0 }
    },
    {
      "name": "retract_snap_to_center_cancels",
      "fireMode": "retract",
      "ring": { "labels": ["a", "b", "c"], "folders": [], "inFolder": false, "anchor": "down" },
      "frames": [
        { "t": 0, "x": 0.0, "y": 1.0 },
        { "t": 200, "x": 0.0, "y": 1.0 },
        { "t": 250, "x": 0.0, "y": 0.2 }
      ],
      "expect": { "aimed": null, "fired": null, "releaseReal": null }
    }
  ],
  "_rust_only_scenarios_note": [
    "In-folder scenarios whose expected seats depend on Back placement.",
    "RUST-ONLY until B7 for the same reason as back_placement_angle: the",
    "phone still uses the old display-index rotation, so the seats differ.",
    "Under the desktop append-Back-and-rotate-by-angle scheme, a 3-real +",
    "Back ring anchored down rotates so up->seat1, left->seat0, right->seat2."
  ],
  "rust_only_scenarios": [
    {
      "name": "folder_up_descends_the_inner_folder_seat",
      "fireMode": "release",
      "ring": { "labels": ["a", "inner", "c"], "folders": [1], "inFolder": true, "anchor": "down" },
      "initialPath": [0],
      "frames": [
        { "t": 0, "x": 0.0, "y": 1.0 },
        { "t": 160, "x": 0.0, "y": 1.0 }
      ],
      "expect": { "aimed": null, "path": [0, 1], "fired": null }
    },
    {
      "name": "folder_left_commits_leaf_a",
      "fireMode": "release",
      "ring": { "labels": ["a", "inner", "c"], "folders": [1], "inFolder": true, "anchor": "down" },
      "initialPath": [0],
      "frames": [
        { "t": 0, "x": -1.0, "y": 0.0 },
        { "t": 160, "x": -1.0, "y": 0.0 }
      ],
      "expect": { "aimed": 0, "path": [0], "fired": null, "releaseReal": 0 }
    }
  ]
}
